  "description": "Less boilerplate. More Entity Framework. Optional helpers for Blazor apps using typed EF Core providers: inherit ready-to-use async CRUD instead of reimplementing it for every entity. No required repository interfaces or per-provider DI registration; safe per-operation DbContext handling. Native EF Core stays available; transactions are optional. Requires .NET 10 / EF Core 10.",
