  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.0.1 patch release for .NET 10 / EF Core 10. Fixes CRUD tracking under global NoTracking (including owned-collection shadow keys), Added-entity ID delete, pending complex-property concurrency, and incompatible mapped subtype updates; entity discovery respects preconfigured complex types. No public API changes; updates with mismatched mapped subtypes are now rejected. See https://github.com/thliborius/EfCoreNexus/blob/v2.0.1/docs/release-notes-2.0.1.md",
